OL,3,GNEWSATwo charged after officer left
OL,4,Awith fractured skull
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and woman have been charged after
OL,7,Fa police officer was left with a
OL,8,Ffractured skull while trying to stop a
OL,9,Fcar.
OL,11,FWarwickshire Police said the officer
OL,12,Fattempted to stop and speak to the
OL,13,Foccupants of a car in Kingswood Road,
OL,14,FNuneaton, at around 15:00 BST on
OL,15,FSunday, when the driver drove off.
OL,17,FThe officer, who has not been
OL,18,Fidentified, suffered a fractured skull
OL,19,Fand remains in hospital in a stable
OL,20,Fcondition, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
