OL,3,GNEWSATwo charged after officer left
OL,4,Awith fractured skull
OL,5,
OL,6,FBilly Thompson, 23, of Hawthorne
OL,7,FTerrace, Nuneaton, was charged with
OL,8,Fgrievous bodily harm with intent,
OL,9,Fcausing serious injury by dangerous
OL,10,Fdriving, driving otherwise than in
OL,11,Faccordance with a licence and driving
OL,12,Fwithout insurance.
